{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "org.orge-8.better-diary",
  "version": "1.10.1",
  "name": "better-diary 日记插件",
  "description": "睡前日记：两阶段生成（先选材，再回查原消息形成场景证据，最后据现场成文），刻意反 AI 腔，成品只发 QQ 空间，聊天里仅回报状态。功能含定时生成（重启不丢当天）、缺档补写、本地检索；自动合并同一人的连续场景，按 1~4 个场景自然成文，近期同人同题材无新进展时跳过；每日日期行都会写天气（聊天证据优先，缺失时用配置兜底），引用与数字无据时不发布，解析失败会补跑且不再用原始时间线兜底。权限 fail-closed：先配 admin_ids 才可用。",
  "author": {
    "name": "orge-8",
    "url": "https://github.com/orge-8"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/orge-8/better-diary"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.2.3",
    "max_version": "1.4.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.8.0",
    "max_version": "2.22.1"
  },
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "type": "python_package",
      "name": "httpx",
      "version_spec": ">=0.27"
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "send.text",
    "api.call",
    "chat.get_stream_by_group_id",
    "chat.get_stream_by_user_id",
    "chat.get_group_streams",
    "chat.get_all_streams",
    "message.get_by_time",
    "message.get_by_time_in_chat",
    "llm.generate",
    "config.get"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN"
  }
}
